OL,3,GNEWSATeenager jailed for life after
OL,4,Akilling gang rival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been jailed for the
OL,7,Fmurder of a 19-year-old following a
OL,8,Fdispute between rival street gangs in
OL,9,FBirmingham.
OL,11,FOumar Traore, 18, stabbed Yassin Alama
OL,12,Fin Hutton Road, the street on which the
OL,13,Fkiller lived, in November last year.
OL,15,FTraore admitted killing Alama in
OL,16,Fself-defence but a jury found him
OL,17,Fguilty of murder and possession of a
OL,18,Fblade at Birmingham Crown Court in
OL,19,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
